@@ -21,6 +21,14 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Command line
+
+Landscape report commands (aggregate the analyses found under an analysis root, e.g. `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json`):
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report. The landscape counterpart of the analysis commands; the same as `updateLandscape`
+* `updateLandscape`: updates or creates a landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses (kept for existing scripts; the same as `analyzeLandscape`)
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
 ### Docker
 
